sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Current owner
    participant AM as Account Manager
    participant Cloud as Video Cloud
    participant Next as Next owner
    Note over Owner,AM: R = /v1/orgs/{orgId}/devices/{deviceId}
    Owner->>AM: HTTPS POST R/unprovision (Account bearer)
    alt Authorized binding release
        AM-->>Owner: 200 unprovision.status=unprovisioned
        AM->>Cloud: Async binding cleanup via internal integration
        Note over AM,Cloud: Preserve factory identity and canonical entitlements
        Next->>AM: HTTPS POST /v1/orgs/{orgId}/devices/claim/resolve (fresh possession proof)
        AM-->>Next: Claim result or rejection
        Note over Next,Cloud: Successful new binding still requires activation workflow
    else Permission or lifecycle conflict
        AM-->>Owner: HTTP 403 or 409
    end
